@@text `NoRecipeUnlockMixin` makes ServerPlayer.awardRecipes and awardRecipesByKey do nothing. Needs the Creative Common jar of 2026-11-17 or later. The Oven and Copper Pot rows are SQ-AV-02 and -03 (Creative Delight, P3b 2026-11-17: their award calls are gone, the XP pop stays); the Keg follows in P3c.
@@table
## SQ-AV-01 | /recipe give learns nothing; the book stays empty
@group A
@commands Fake player: `/recipe give rbk1 *`, then `/recipe give rbk1 minecraft:furnace`, then `/recipe take rbk1 *`
@pass both gives answer "No new recipes were learned"; the take answers "No recipes could be forgotten" (nothing was added); boot log has no mixin error naming NoRecipeUnlockMixin
@fails mixin not applied (`bootexpect` on creativecommon.mixins.json, the SRG names m_7281_ / m_7902_), or Common older than 2026-11-17
> pbot spawn rbk1 0 -60 0 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
> recipe give rbk1 *
waitlog No new recipes were learned 20
> recipe give rbk1 minecraft:furnace
sleep 2
count No new recipes were learned >= 2
> recipe take rbk1 *
waitlog No recipes could be forgotten 20
reject Unlocked \d+ recipes? for
bootreject NoRecipeUnlockMixin.*(InvalidInjectionException|could not find|failed)
> pbot remove rbk1
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|s5)\] (error|no player)|\[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=))

## SQ-AV-02 | Oven: taking a bake pops XP, unlocks nothing
@group A
@commands Fake player rbk2 with an empty recipe book; a Creative Delight Oven on a heat source bakes one recipe; take the result by hand (or break the Oven with the result inside)
@pass XP orbs spawn at the player (or at the Oven when broken) as before; `/recipe take rbk2 *` answers "No recipes could be forgotten"; no `awardRecipes` in a stack trace
@fails no XP: `OvenBlockEntity.popExperience` not called from `OvenResultSlot`; recipes learned: the Common mixin missing and the Oven still awarding (Delight older than 2026-11-17)
@draft no driver step takes an Oven result slot by hand; owner LOOK, or break the Oven with a finished bake inside and count XP orbs
## SQ-AV-03 | Copper Pot: taking a meal pops XP, unlocks nothing
@group A
@commands As SQ-AV-02 with Miner's Delight's Copper Pot cooking one Farmer's Delight pot recipe
@pass XP as before; no recipe learned; Create Central Kitchen's blaze stove still drives the pot (its mixin targets `setRecipeUsed`, kept)
@fails as SQ-AV-02 (`CopperPotBlockEntity.popExperience`, `CopperPotResultSlot`); a mixin error naming `CopperPotBlockEntityMixin` (Central Kitchen): the method shape changed
@draft no driver step takes a pot result slot by hand; owner LOOK

